      "tags": ["gratitude", "daily"],
      "arabicText": "الْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِينَ",
      "transliteration": "Alhamdu lillahi rabbil 'alamin",
      "translation": "All praise is for Allah, Lord of the worlds.",
