      "title": "Before Sleep",
      "category": "evening",
      "tags": ["sleep", "evening"],
      "arabicText": "بِاسْمِكَ اللَّهُمَّ أَمُوتُ وَأَحْيَا",
      "transliteration": "Bismika Allahumma amutu wa ahya",
      "translation": "In Your name, O Allah, I die and I live.",
